##
## Upstream tests to disable
##
## When adding a new filter to this list, please include a short description of
## why the filter is required and create an associated tracking issue.
##

# The tests below launch a PWA app shim through LaunchServices. Doing so from a
# volume macOS treats as removable can raise an unanswerable TCC consent prompt,
# which parks a sandboxd worker thread and eventually deadlocks sandboxd
# machine-wide. In more recent branches of this repo, we have a fix that works
# by launching the app shim with fork/exec rather than LaunchServices. Because
# this is a more stable branch, we instead simply disable the tests. The list
# below was obtained via a full browser_tests run instrumented at both shim
# launch sites; see https://github.com/brave/devops/issues/16445

-All/DiscardEligibilityPolicyWebAppBrowserTest.*
-All/WebAppScopeExtensionsBrowserTest.*
-All/WebAppScopeExtensionsDisabledBrowserTest.*
-AppBrowserControllerBrowserTest.*
-AppBrowserDocumentPictureInPictureBrowserTest.*
-AppHomePageHandlerUpdateTest.*
